New kind, own domain FRACTALAI-agent-commerce-receipt-v1 and key use commerce-receipt.
Closed ASCII-only body (v, protocol, profile, issued_at, payment, bindings, delivery).
JS kernel + Python port; 44 new corpus vectors (6 positive, 38 negative); both 217/217.
Production epoch 3 has no commerce-receipt key (asserted by N-AC-production-directory-has-no-commerce-key).

